      "title": "Jeremy C. Thurston '00 Center for Career Readiness",
      "description": "Jeremy C. Thurston '00 Center for Career Readiness | Utica University Skip to main site navigation Skip to main content Virtual Tour | Visit Campus | Contact Us | Apply  Now Academics Programs Online Programs Online Business Programs Honors Program Graduate Study International Ed & Study Abroad Study Abroad Exceptional Faculty Student Support and Success Schedules, Catalogs, and Resources Institutes and Centers Utica University at Florida Tuition and Fees: ABSN Program Accepted Students Current Offerings General Education Planning Sheet Themed Pathways Opportunity Programs Tuition and Financial Aid Understanding Financial Aid Value Excelsior, Explained University Scholarships Annual Awards Applying For Financial Aid Tuition and Fees Utica Campus Programs Online Programs ABSN Program Net Price Calculator Pioneer Passport Admissions First-Year Admissions Transfer Admissions Articulation Agreements Graduate Admissions Graduate Inquiry Form New Graduate Students International Applicants International Inquiry Form Frequently Asked Questions Visit Utica University Campus Virtual Tour Why Not Fly? Apply Now Contact Us Accepted Student Info High School Counselors High School Bridge Program Community Living on Campus Res Life & Student Living Student Involvement & Leadership Wilcox Center The Utica Area Hotels and Restaurants in the Utica Area Utica Stories About Utica Athletics Intercollegiate Athletics Esports News & Events Alumni Giving Apply Now Directory About Library Logins Open the search panel Search Utica University Go Click to access the searchbar Click to access the menu Jeremy C. Thurston '00 Center for Career Readiness Directory Jeremy C. Thurston '00 Center for Career Readiness What We Do The Jeremy C. Thurston '00 Center for Career Readiness serves students in partnership with alumni, employers, faculty, and staff, through services and resources that include coaching, assessments, programming, outreach, and recruitment activities. Phone (315) 792-3409 Email cebonave@utica.edu Department Type Administrative Office Location 120 White Hall Hours Monday-Friday, 8:30 a.m. to 5:00 p.m. More In This Section Click to expose navigation links on mobile. Center For Career Readiness Overview of Services Students #UCMySuccess Employers Faculty and Staff Alumni Additional Resources Our Staff Career Mentor Program The time to start planning for tomorrow is today. Let us help. Our Mission The mission of the Jeremy C. Thurston ’00 Center for Career Readiness is to provide services and resources that enhance and support students’ career development and graduate school readiness, preparing them for successful post-graduation careers. Career Management System Schedule a Major/Career Exploration Appointment through Handshake . Handshake is The Center’s career management system and is designed to create connections between students/alumni, employers, and The Center’s staff. Features include job and internship postings, event and workshop registrations, and the ability to schedule an appointment with The Center’s Career Coaching Program staff. Account Login: Student Login New Employers ( Employers: Please read our posting policy ) Questions? Contact the Center or visit the Handshake Help Guide . QUICK LINKS: Resources and Guides Meet the Staff Micro-Internships with Parker Dewey Request a Class Presentation Follow us on Instagram Internships and Careers Akemi Reyes '20 Cybersecurity Microsoft 365 Specialist at ZONES, Inc. (job) Madison Judge '21 Public Relations Marketing Intern at Total Solutions More #UCMySuccess Stories Close Window I would like to see logins and resources for: Which audience would you like to see logins and resources for? Current Undergraduate Students Current Graduate Students Current Online Students Admitted Students Parents and Families Faculty Staff Submit For a general list of frequently used logins, you can also visit our logins page . Facebook Twitter Instagram YouTube Academics Tuition and Financial Aid Admissions Community Athletics 1600 Burrstone Road, Utica, NY 13502 Map & Directions (315) 792-3006 Contact Us Institutional Effectiveness Bookstore Disability Learning Support Student Right to Know"
